# My Diller

B2B ulgurji platforma (`milliycrm.uz`). Integratsiyasiz: Didox/Click/Payme/Telegram yo‘q.

## Papkalar ↔ domenlar

| Papka | Domen | Rol |
|-------|-------|-----|
| `landing` | milliycrm.uz | Marketing + kabinet linklari |
| `admin` | admin.milliycrm.uz | Bosh admin / general |
| `admin-kurator` | kurator.milliycrm.uz | Kurator CRM |
| `ishlab chiqaruvchi` | zavod.milliycrm.uz | Zavod |
| `foydalanuvchi` | user.milliycrm.uz | Xaridor |
| `dostavka` | yetkazish.milliycrm.uz | Logistika |
| `backend` | api.milliycrm.uz | Go API |

## Qoidalar

- Frontend API URL faqat `src/shared/config.ts` da (`https://api.milliycrm.uz/api/v1`). `.env` / `VITE_API_URL` ishlatilmasin.
- Backend sozlamalar `backend/config.json` da (CORS, upload, DB, JWT).
- UI tili: o‘zbek (lotin). Xabarlar/snackbar ham o‘zbekcha.
- Mavjud dizayn: `#102d26` / `#c9f560`, Tailwind 4, framer-motion — yangi UI shu uslubda.
- Commit / push faqat foydalanuvchi so‘raganda.
- Buyurtma oqimini o‘zgartirishda barcha rollar (xaridor, zavod, dostavka, kurator, admin) ni tekshir.
